	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2020-01-14 08:34:51.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (LAND ICE/OCEAN CLASSIFICATION [dbe8d9d3-1609-4128-9b45-1061a501401b,559647] - CRYOSPHERE [fa0a36c3-2503-4662-98cd-7f3e74ce9f80,84411]); 
</changeNote>
