	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Reports providing information pertaining to the study of frozen seawater over
the ocean surface.&lt;br&gt;&#xD;
Sea Ice Advisory Services include warnings for ice melting, and daily analyses
through real time data and forecast.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
