	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Ferns, of the phylum Pterophyta, with 12,000 species, are the largest group
of seedless vascular plants, and are in mainly tropical, temperate
habitats.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
