add broader relation (LUMINESCENCE [f8740a28-ec13-4ce8-8541-2ecae035b297,82997] - METAMORPHIC ROCK PHYSICAL/OPTICAL PROPERTIES [2d38e7c6-8169-49e9-ab9d-0d0f690cce04,82971]); 
