</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019-08-28 13:29:40.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURE [bd24a9a9-7d52-4c29-b2a0-6cefd216ae78,83965] - SEA SURFACE TEMPERATURE ANOMALY [904f3b34-20c8-4eb8-bf68-6304edecf945,369099]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A measure of the average kinetic energy of the vibration of water
molecules, measured or estimated at the sea surface.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
