	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The flow of water beneath earth's surface as part of the water cycle. In the water cycle, when precipitation falls on the earth's land, some of the water flows on the surface forming streams and rivers.</definition>
