	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Oxygen demand or biochemical oxygen demand is the amount of oxygen that will
be absorbed or "demanded" as wastes are being digested or oxidized in
both biological and chemical processes.</definition>
