add narrower relation (REFLECTANCE [00a21e9c-0c1d-4931-b9fa-b0204625a98a,368895] - BIDIRECTIONAL REFLECTANCE DISTRIBUTION FUNCTION [2dce1d90-f958-4e96-b8d8-c8b0bc69d16e,368899]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019-06-21 12:31:02.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (REFLECTANCE [00a21e9c-0c1d-4931-b9fa-b0204625a98a,368895] - SNOW/ICE [aa35a52f-e3d9-41bd-abd2-ec7e1a8101d1,83599]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2019-08-26 09:50:55.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (REFLECTANCE [00a21e9c-0c1d-4931-b9fa-b0204625a98a,368895] - BIDIRECTIONAL REFLECTANCE FACTOR [eddd1f51-a6ae-4c35-bac5-e68131fcb386,369063]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A general term referring to the radiation reflected from, or scattered back through, a given surface in response to radiation incident on the surface with the same wavelength or wavelength range.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">REFLECTANCE</prefLabel>
	<reference xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx2262"/>
	<narrower xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/2dce1d90-f958-4e96-b8d8-c8b0bc69d16e"/>
