	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A measure of the ability of a soil to transfer heat (through a unit
thickness, across a unit area for a unit difference in temperature).</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
