	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2016-05-12 15:54:58.0 [gee-cee]  
insert AltLabel (id: null
text: ATMOSPHERIC CHEMISTRY/CARBON AND HYDROCARBON COMPOUNDS
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Measurements of chemical constituents in the atmosphere including the
major (non-H2O) greenhouse gases (CO2, CH4, CFC, N2O).</definition>
