	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Trace gases in the atmosphere that do not occur in large quantities but&#xD;
are significant to life on Earth or are important constituents of the&#xD;
chemical cycles in the atmosphere. [Journal of American Hygienist&#xD;
Association; v54; 639-46; 1993.] [Atmospheric Environment B; v27B; 275-82;&#xD;
1993.]</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
