<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/cb4d21ab-70a8-4111-be0a-e5508b256110">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"/>
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	<broader xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/d2f152e1-7398-44ad-b0a4-77ee6ef5bd6c"/>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2024-02-28 14:49:38.0 [tstevens]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: The quantification of the precise amount of a specific DNA or RNA molecule in a sample. Absolute abundance provides the quantitative abundance of DNA or RNA in a sample, as opposed to the relative abundance produced by traditional PCR methods. Two common methods to determine absolute abundance include:
Cell-based methods such as flow cytometry used in ddPCR
Molecular methods used in qPCR
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2024-02-28 13:53:15.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (ABSOLUTE ABUNDANCE [cb4d21ab-70a8-4111-be0a-e5508b256110,1603383] - OMICS METHODOLOGY [d2f152e1-7398-44ad-b0a4-77ee6ef5bd6c,1603367]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The quantification of the precise amount of a specific DNA or RNA molecule in a sample. Absolute abundance provides the quantitative abundance of DNA or RNA in a sample, as opposed to the relative abundance produced by traditional PCR methods. Two common methods to determine absolute abundance include:
Cell-based methods such as flow cytometry used in ddPCR
Molecular methods used in qPCR</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">ABSOLUTE ABUNDANCE</prefLabel>
