</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The total amount of dissolved material in water and its effect on
water's mass-to-volume ratio.  Scientific measurements related to either
salinity or density are included under this Term.</definition>
