add narrower relation (HUMIDITY INDICES [b881cf8f-7260-4980-80bc-4b6ae3716c39,23137] - TEMPERATURE-HUMIDITY INDEX [5bdc74e2-ea3a-4d1d-b64e-9eaf3a879545,39683]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A measure or indicator of some aspect of humidity.</definition>
