</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-18 14:56:33.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (SEDIMENTATION [2cca0a13-3c6f-4617-aca9-bff7f8142c52,82643] - SEDIMENT COMPOSITION [17d6838d-e05e-4f0f-a751-7dbd00d2a80a,82647]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-18 14:33:47.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SEDIMENTATION [2cca0a13-3c6f-4617-aca9-bff7f8142c52,82643] - COASTAL PROCESSES [672d6958-4bbc-4b33-adc8-927e4348908b,82553]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-18 14:55:48.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
