	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A hazard event arising from geophysical processes or biological agents -- such as those creating earthquakes, hurricanes, or locust infestations -- that affect the lives, livelihood, and property of people.</definition>
