update Definition (Temperature is defined, in general, as the degree of hotness or coldness measured on some definite temperature scale by means of any of various types of thermometers;In meteorology, a profile is defined as a
graph of the value of a scalar quantity versus a horizontal, vertical, or time scale.   It usually refers to a vertical representation.); 
update Definition (Glossary of Meteorology, American Meteorological Society, 1998. ); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-09-04 14:45:09.0 [epneff] Insert Concept 
