	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A set of parameters that describe the changing climate with a focus on the paleoclimate, which can include marine sediments, ice cores, tree rings, pollen diatoms, microbiota, charcoal, and BIFs.</definition>
