	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A subtropical cyclone in which the maximum sustained surface wind speed (using the U.S. 1-minute average) is 33 kt (38 mph or 62 km/hr) or less.</definition>
