Baum, Texas Center for Climate Studies, Texas A&amp;M University, Copyright&#xD;
1995-1996, January 20, 1997,&#xD;
http://stommel.tamu.edu/~baum/paleo/ocean/ocean.html</text>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/eb9b8c19-3b39-4865-bcfc-d2a12689094a">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"/>
