</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-12 10:04:45.0 [mpmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TROPOSPHERIC/HIGH-LEVEL CLOUDS (OBSERVED/ANALYZED) [705cd3a0-ea07-40c8-bfa1-9c26f22d13ba,82123] - CLOUDS [162e2243-3266-4999-b352-d8a1a9dc82ac,62017]); 
