	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2017-03-15 11:56:14.0 [mgenazzi] Definition updated 
update Definition (A set of deposited sedimentary beds that reflects the depositional environment of those beds and the geologic history of a region. A stratigraphic sequence is a chronologic succession of sedimentary rocks from older below to younger above without interruption.); 
update Definition (Adapted from: Press, F. and Siever, R. 1986. Earth. W.H. Freeman and Company.  Fourth Edition. p. 645.  also:  Jackson, J.A., ed. 1997. Glossary of Geology, 4th edition. American Geological  Institute.); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-08-05 14:15:35.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (STRATIGRAPHIC SEQUENCE [a7b04d56-2a44-4a94-8d94-1911a7110f9d,105457] - SEDIMENTATION [5fff607c-5df4-4f06-a541-896f7cbc1e4c,105447]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-08-20 10:20:18.0 [tbs1979]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: A chronological succession of sedimentary rocks.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A set of deposited sedimentary beds that reflects the depositional environment of those beds and the geologic history of a region. A stratigraphic sequence is a chronologic succession of sedimentary rocks from older below to younger above without interruption.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">STRATIGRAPHIC SEQUENCE</prefLabel>
	<reference xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx2265"/>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/9ea3e92d-f772-4f39-a615-08b0e062ee9d">
