	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2016-03-31 08:12:24.0 [gee-cee] Move Concepts 
add narrower relation (SURFACE WATER PROCESSES/MEASUREMENTS [9d86cd70-062a-4c39-b3f3-226abebc07f7,158723] - DRAINAGE [269c7277-fa8f-4c1c-bd8b-ab772c1df4e5,83903]); 
