<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/20a8731e-4a5f-4f0a-ad96-3e28274cc90a">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"/>
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	<broader xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/d2f152e1-7398-44ad-b0a4-77ee6ef5bd6c"/>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2024-02-28 15:08:39.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (DROPLET DIGITAL POLYMERASE CHAIN REACTION _ddPCR_ [20a8731e-4a5f-4f0a-ad96-3e28274cc90a,1603386] - OMICS METHODOLOGY [d2f152e1-7398-44ad-b0a4-77ee6ef5bd6c,1603367]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2024-02-28 15:09:12.0 [tstevens]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: Droplet Digital PCR (ddPCR) is a method for performing digital PCR that is based on water-oil emulsion droplet technology. A sample is fractionated into 20,000 droplets, and PCR amplification of the template molecules occurs in each individual droplet. ddPCR is a version of PCR that enables the exact quantification of nucleic acid targets within a sample.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2024-02-28 15:09:48.0 [tstevens]  
update PrefLabel (DROPLET DIGITAL POLYMERASE CHAIN REACTION (ddPCR)); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Droplet Digital PCR (ddPCR) is a method for performing digital PCR that is based on water-oil emulsion droplet technology. A sample is fractionated into 20,000 droplets, and PCR amplification of the template molecules occurs in each individual droplet. ddPCR is a version of PCR that enables the exact quantification of nucleic acid targets within a sample.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">DROPLET DIGITAL POLYMERASE CHAIN REACTION (ddPCR)</prefLabel>
	<reference xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx316"/>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx316">
