</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-03-11 15:27:14.0 [tbs1979]  
update Definition (The relation between the earth's interior heat and other related matter, using the properties of macroscopic variables such as temperature, entropy, and pressure.); 
update Definition (Merriam-Webster Dictionary); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The relation between the earth's interior heat and other related matter, using the properties of macroscopic variables such as temperature, entropy, and pressure.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
