	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A naturally occurring, usually inorganic substance that is not considered to be a mineral because it is amorphous and lacks a periodically repeating arrangement of atoms, e.g. opal.</definition>
