	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Anomaly of the average of the monthly SST from Eq-20S and 10E-30W. GISST and NOAA OI 1x1 datasets are used to create index. Climatology is 1951-2000.</definition>
