	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Any measure related to the composition of harvested forage, such as
hay, fodder, silage, grain, or other processed feed for livestock.  May
include new mixes, new types, etc..., and any additives.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
