	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Lesson Plans are defined as Education / Outreach Services that comprise a set of courses, sections, or teaching modules related to a topic or topics within the Earth Sciences and/or Global Environmental Change.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
