	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Curriculum Support Services are defined as Education/Outreach Services that are designed to supplement primary Earth Science and/or Global Environmental Change teaching methods and materials. These materials will either reinforce
understanding of a previously introduced concept or will introduce a new concept not covered by primary materials.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
