	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-18 09:53:13.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (AM INDEX [b3283844-d867-4c2f-9917-a72bc06fd9ef,82405] - GEOMAGNETIC INDICES [ae35f430-6534-49de-8b4c-edfc1e98870a,62733]); 
