	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012-06-26 12:45:49.0 [gee-cee] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (CRYOSPHERIC INDICATORS [76b8c21c-c221-4724-86ef-c07222cb152b,39899] - CLIMATE INDICATORS [23703b6b-ee15-4512-b5b2-f441547e2edf,22891]); 
</changeNote>
