	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Rounded, well-bonded snow that is older han one year (from NSIDC glossary). A
permeable aggregate of small ice grains with densities greater than 0.55 up to
0.82 where begins glacial ice.</definition>
