	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The height of the ocean surface above a datum, such as a vertical datum
for sea level measurements, or a reference ellipsoid for satellite
altimetric measurements.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
