	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A glacial landform made by a stream flowing through glacial ice and depositing material upon entering a lake or pond at the end or terminus of the glacier, thus "in front" of it, a proglacial lake.</definition>
