	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The biosphere is made up of the parts of Earth where life exists. The biosphere extends from the deepest root systems of trees, to the dark environment of ocean trenches, to lush rain forests and high mountaintops.</definition>
