	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022-03-02 17:37:04.0 [sritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (PEROXYNITRIC ACID [c2b7b126-8737-4933-ba27-fe64226a0363,836050] - NITROGEN COMPOUNDS [9e5ec924-2fd3-4cbb-a7eb-ffde114d0cb9,832492]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Peroxynitric acid is a nitrogen oxoacid. It is a conjugate acid of a peroxynitrate.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">PEROXYNITRIC ACID</prefLabel>
	<reference xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx1297"/>
</rdf:Description>

