	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">tube of sediment collected from the bed of a water body, allowing the analysis of layers of which it is made up, leading to information on seabed / lakebed character, depositional history and environmental change.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">SEDIMENT CORE</prefLabel>
