	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">MAGs represent a microbial genome by a group of sequences from genome assembly with similar characteristics. It enables researchers to identify novel species and understand their potential functions in a dynamic ecosystem.</definition>
