	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">With respect to pollution, the discharge of gases or particles from a
source such as a smokestack or exhaust pipe into the atmosphere, perhaps
resulting in environmental pollution. With respect to radiation, the
generation and sending out of radiant energy.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
