<rdf:Description rdf:about="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/5bac3ef6-5e30-4f14-a5dc-8065c7fcba55">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Resource"/>
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	<broader xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/62019831-aaba-4d63-a5cd-73138ccfa5d0"/>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-03-21 14:16:13.0 [mpmorahan]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: In meteorology, the result of radiative cooling of the earth's surface and adjacent air.

Radiational cooling occurs, as is typical on calm, clear nights, whenever the longwave emission from the surface is not balanced by significant amounts of absorbed shortwave radiation or downwelling longwave from the atmosphere above the surface, and there are no nonradiative sources of sufficient energy to make up the difference.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-14 12:39:38.0 [mpmorahan] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (RADIATIONAL COOLING [5bac3ef6-5e30-4f14-a5dc-8065c7fcba55,82289] - CLOUD DYNAMICS [62019831-aaba-4d63-a5cd-73138ccfa5d0,82131]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">In meteorology, the result of radiative cooling of the earth's surface and adjacent air.

Radiational cooling occurs, as is typical on calm, clear nights, whenever the longwave emission from the surface is not balanced by significant amounts of absorbed shortwave radiation or downwelling longwave from the atmosphere above the surface, and there are no nonradiative sources of sufficient energy to make up the difference.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">RADIATIONAL COOLING</prefLabel>
	<reference xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx1703"/>
</rdf:Description>

