	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Growth Stage is defined as the phenological growth stage and is measured on the BBCH (Biologische Bundesanstalt, Bundessortenamt and Chemical industry) Scale.</definition>
