	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">An area of land where precipitation collects and drains off into a common outlet, such as into a river, bay, or other body of water, but considers the flow of ice over the frozen continent.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">BASINS</prefLabel>
