	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The ratio of cross polarized to co-polarized lidar signal return reflected back
in a direction opposite to that of the incident radiation from a lidar&#xD;
transmission.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
