	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Food-web Dynamics denotes the complex network of interconnected food chains.
 Food chains are innumberable pathways where one organism is eaten by a
second, which is eaten by a third.</definition>
