Production in the Northeast Pacific Ocean. In: R.J.  Beamish [ed.]&#xD;
Ocean climate and northern fish populations. Can. spec. Pub. Fish. Aquat. Sci.&#xD;
121, pp. 357-372.&#xD;
"http://ww2.wrh.noaa.gov/climate_info/PDO_page.htm"</text>
</rdf:Description>

