	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2016-06-15 08:45:15.0 [gee-cee] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (FRACTION OF ABSORBED PHOTOSYNTHETICALLY ACTIVE RADIATION (FAPAR) [6079e5e4-4dee-4b32-aaa8-ae3231bcbadb,188275] - PHOTOSYNTHETICALLY ACTIVE RADIATION [db69ecb1-0738-4d82-943f-ae92093f500d,84869]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2016-06-15 08:45:51.0 [gee-cee]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: The fraction of the incoming solar radiation in the Photosynthetically Active Radiation spectral region that is absorbed by a photosynthetic organism, typically describing the light absorption across an integrated plant canopy.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The fraction of the incoming solar radiation in the Photosynthetically Active Radiation spectral region that is absorbed by a photosynthetic organism, typically describing the light absorption across an integrated plant canopy.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">FRACTION OF ABSORBED PHOTOSYNTHETICALLY ACTIVE RADIATION (FAPAR)</prefLabel>
	<reference xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" rdf:nodeID="node1igi5qapbx2135"/>
</rdf:Description>

