text: The emission of “cold light” from minerals. There are several varieties of luminescence, each named according to the source of energy, or the trigger for the luminescence.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-03-05 13:16:58.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
