C., Marengo, J. A. and Carvalho, M. A. (2018), Frequency, duration and severity of drought in the Semiarid Northeast Brazil region. Int. J. Climatol, 38: 517-529. doi:10.1002/joc.5225</text>
</rdf:Description>

