Hall, NY. Carleton, A.M. Satellite Remote Sensing in Climatology, Belhaven&#xD;
Press, London, UK.&#xD;
Solar Activity, Einar Tandberg-Hanssen, Blaisdale Publishing Co. Waltham, MA,
1967.</text>
</rdf:Description>

