	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Cloud Liquid Water - The amount of liquid water per unit volume of air.
Usually expressed in grams per cubic meter. Cloud Ice - Ice crystals
that are observed within a cloud.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
