	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Measurments related to any transportable animal resource product
with commercial value; all animal resource products which are articles of
commerce.  Does NOT include Apicultural/Sericultural products (see
Apiculture or Sericulture).</definition>
