insert Definition (id: null
text: Measurement across the solar irradiance spectrum and not a particular band or wavelength in general, but in practice it's based on the particular bands of the sensor. Example:  Generating TOA Reflectance for band 1, band 2, etc. The keyword doesn't inherently cover a set wavelength or band.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2021-02-26 12:44:07.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
