update PrefLabel (TOP OF ATMOSPHERE (TOA) REFLECTANCE); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Measurement across the solar irradiance spectrum and not a particular band or wavelength in general, but in practice it's based on the particular bands of the sensor. Example:  Generating TOA Reflectance for band 1, band 2, etc. The keyword doesn't inherently cover a set wavelength or band.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">TOP OF ATMOSPHERE (TOA) REFLECTANCE</prefLabel>
