add broader relation (FOOD SECURITY [85a73755-cb84-40cb-a23e-2ed3811138f8,368547] - PUBLIC HEALTH [da2c70fd-d92b-45be-b159-b2c10cb387c6,83869]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A state that prevails when people have secure access to sufficient amounts of safe and nutritious food for normal growth, development,and an active and healthy life.</definition>
