add broader relation (SLEET [5beaf99c-0675-4af3-9236-f55d8d206d85,86333] - ICE PELLETS [cac27b59-7810-4132-87b4-53108663584e,106309]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">In the United States, frozen rain drops that bounce on impact with the
ground or other objects. Elsewhere, may refer to a mix of rain and snow, a
mix of rain and hail, or melting snow.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
