	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">A measure of the amount of radiation propagated through a given medium.
defined as the ratio of transmitted radiation to the total radiation
incident upon the medium. Also known as transmissivity.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
