</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The mass fraction of total dissolved solids/salt per kilogram of seawater. In practice, this mass is difficult to determine. A protocol was adopted in 1902 by an international commission to approach the value of the dissolved substance mass.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
