	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
	<broader xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concept/7406a787-6ab6-429f-bc09-9a86d393e114"/>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The fitness of water for use (by plants or animals), being affected by&#xD;
physical, chemical and biological factors.&lt;p&gt;&#xD;
A Water Quality Advisory may include information on the types of contaminants&#xD;
that may decrease the water quality in a particular area.&lt;br&gt;</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
