	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Solar radiation is the total electromagnetic radiation emitted by the Sun.
Also could include insolation, direct solar radiation, diffuse radiation,
solar irradiance, and shortwave radiation.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">SOLAR RADIATION</prefLabel>
