text: The temperature to which a given air parcel must be cooled at constant 
pressure and constant water vapor content in order for saturation to 
occur.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-09-04 14:45:09.0 [epneff] Insert Concept 
