update Definition (Dictionary of Geological Terms, American Geological Institute, 1984. ); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The process of picking up and carrying along, as the collecting and movement of sediment by currents.</definition>
