	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012-06-26 12:11:25.0 [gee-cee] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (LENGTH OF FREEZE FREE PERIOD [738185b7-54d6-41a2-b31f-b8a4ee1dabe7,39857] - LENGTH OF GROWING SEASON [ed8797be-661a-48c9-a7fe-2600b6c7c067,39849]); 
