	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Phylum Chordata. Class Mammalia. Order Artiodactyla. Family Suidae are omnivores, even toed-ungulates with a large head and a long strengthened snout. Hog is a common name for domestic pig weighing more than 120lbs.</definition>
