</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2021-10-20 09:26:16.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (VORTICITY [55715ed3-471e-46a8-97b6-b463708a2cbe,776114] - POTENTIAL VORTICITY [aad49974-99ab-4623-a716-ea73e2f46ad1,778213]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Measure of the rotational spin about an axis at some point within a fluid.</definition>
