	<text xmlns="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms#" xml:lang="en">Huschke, R.E. 1959. Glossary of Meteorology. American Meteorological
Association, Boston, MA. See also: Pickard, G.L. and W.J. Emery. 1990.
Descriptive Physical Oceanography: An Introduction. Pergamon Press, NY</text>
</rdf:Description>

