	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022-07-27 15:37:05.0 [tstevens]  
update Definition (Encyclopedia of Machine Learning and Data Science: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-1-4899-7502-7); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022-07-26 07:58:11.0 [tstevens]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: A machine learning model type that uses both supervised and unsupervised learning in its approach. Semi-supervised techniques take advantage of both labelled and unlabeled data.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2022-07-25 15:43:07.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
