	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Wave speed: Distance a wave travels per time.  Wave direction: The
line along which a wave travels with respect to its compass heading.
Both Wave Speed and Wave Direction may be included as Detailed Variables
under Wave Speed/Direction.</definition>
