	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Unconsolidated particles created by the weathering and erosion of rock, by chemical precipitation from solution in water, or from the secretions of organisms, and transported by water, wind, or glaciers.</definition>
