	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-02-18 08:56:26.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (ELLIPSOID CHARACTERISTICS [bc640e63-70c1-4228-b2dc-6aa1ac6edfa6,82375] - GEODETICS [5498572c-aaed-4c08-8aad-8b297057e9c9,82369]); 
