</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2016-06-28 14:04:34.0 [saritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (WATER SPOUT [2992d7d3-5ae6-4844-b0fa-4ad348e3a8c2,217727] - TORNADOES [a200e677-384a-42d6-8519-1c7735f0adb9,84177]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">In general, any tornado over a body of water.</definition>
