	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2016-06-28 14:03:38.0 [saritz] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (ENHANCED FUJITA SCALE RATING [d866f0ba-c70a-4377-9f91-58ab402f6f8b,217725] - TORNADOES [a200e677-384a-42d6-8519-1c7735f0adb9,84177]); 
