</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The speed of the Earth as it rotates upon its axis, while moving around the Sun in the same sense, or direction, as its rotation. This component is not consistent each year.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
