	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2021-02-26 13:09:17.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (SULFUR HEXAFLUORIDE SURFACE [fceaf7e0-c22b-40a1-ba1d-37616031dba6,560885] - SULFUR HEXAFLUORIDE [b4c7dec8-6a9a-4424-8f80-4ad1ed0bc5ec,560883]); 
