	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Management of the human use of the biosphere so that it may yield the greatest&#xD;
sustainable benefit to present generations while maintaining its potential to&#xD;
meet the needs and aspirations of future generations. It includes the&#xD;
preservation, maintenance, sustainable utilisation, restoration and enhancement
of the environment.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
