	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Mapping of ​hazards caused by the occurrence, movement, or distribution of surface and subsurface freshwater and saltwater. Examples include flooding, drought, mudslides, and avalanches.</definition>
