	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2021-02-26 13:12:11.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add narrower relation (ULTRAVIOLET RADIATION [90e7fd13-2da2-4ba6-9e0c-dbecdf7c2215,85405] - UV SPECTRAL [782b60de-9ac2-4e6c-9dfa-cd52c4cf1ea0,560886]); 
