add broader relation (OCEAN BOTTOM PRESSURE [73311948-541c-4960-ae2b-2e82a79aa621,606940] - OCEAN PRESSURE [bfa56100-6fb5-4e49-9633-298fa3b45508,603554]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The sum of the mass of the atmosphere and ocean in a "cylinder" above the seafloor.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
