add broader relation (HARDNESS [a2c042a4-2658-48c1-a511-7a5dbff2b63d,83097] - METEORITE PHYSICAL/OPTICAL PROPERTIES [3ff47a50-2f58-489b-96a7-74e1d40cf0f2,83087]); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2013-03-07 08:10:20.0 [tbs1979] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (HARDNESS [a2c042a4-2658-48c1-a511-7a5dbff2b63d,83097] - METEORITE VERTICAL/GEOGRPAHIC DISTRIBUTION [e468e55a-5bee-413e-8cbd-c9706e28eb93,83091]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">In mineralogy the property of matter commonly described as the resistance of a substance to being scratched by another substance.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
