	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Carbon species that are hydrocarbons or hydrocarbon derivatives. Variables
such as particulate organic carbon (POC) are included as detailed
variables under organic carbon.</definition>
