	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Ice that has been squeezed together, and in places, forced upwards&#xD;
and downwards. Some subdivisions of deformed ice are rafted ice, ridged&#xD;
ice, and hummocked ice.</definition>
	<inScheme xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">ICE DEFORMATION</prefLabel>
