text: Phylum Chordata. Class Mammalia. Order Carnivora. Family Mustelidae are small carnivorous mammals with short legs, round ears and thick fur.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Phylum Chordata. Class Mammalia. Order Carnivora. Family Mustelidae are small carnivorous mammals with short legs, round ears and thick fur.</definition>
