add broader relation (SEVERE CYCLONIC STORMS (N. INDIAN) [40f7445f-1741-418e-9831-e2e3322daf5a,247545] - MAXIMUM SURFACE WIND [106461af-377c-4dc0-bbd7-9769eba05321,247493]); 
