	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The timeseries is calculated from the HadISST and the NCEP OI Datasets. It is the standardized Nina 12 minus the Nina 4 with a 5 month running mean applied which is then standardized using the 1950-1979 period.</definition>
