	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2021-03-03 09:05:03.0 [tstevens]  
insert Definition (id: null
text: The total amount of ozone present in a column of the earth's atmosphere, often expressed in Dobson units.
language code: en); 
</changeNote>
	<changeNote xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2021-02-26 09:37:54.0 [tstevens] Insert Concept 
add broader relation (TOTAL OZONE [b9107ec3-c777-4e71-9046-55bd7ed57ef0,560875] - ATMOSPHERIC OZONE [dd316647-9043-40c3-9329-f22f9215fefa,84479]); 
</changeNote>
	<definition xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">The total amount of ozone present in a column of the earth's atmosphere, often expressed in Dobson units.</definition>
